# Profit Statement
| Line Item           || 2024                                                                    | 2025                                                                          |
| ------------------- || ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| [Revenue]           ||                                                                         |                                                                               |
|   Product Revenue   || 400                                                                     | 450                                                                           |
|   Service Revenue   || 200                                                                     | 240                                                                           |
| Revenue Total       || 600 = @[Revenue."Product Revenue",_] + @[Revenue."Service Revenue",_]   | 690 = @[Revenue."Product Revenue",2025] + @[Revenue."Service Revenue",2025]   |
| [Cost of Sales]     ||                                                                         |                                                                               |
|   Materials         || 250                                                                     | 280                                                                           |
|   Fulfillment       || 80                                                                      | 95                                                                            |
| Cost of Sales Total || 330 = @["Cost of Sales".Materials,_] + @["Cost of Sales".Fulfillment,_] | 375 = @["Cost of Sales".Materials,2025] + @["Cost of Sales".Fulfillment,2025] |
| Gross Profit        || 270 = @["Revenue Total",_] - @["Cost of Sales Total",_]                 | 315 = @["Revenue Total",2025] - @["Cost of Sales Total",2025]                 |
| Margin Check        || true = @["Gross Profit",_] == 270                                       | true = @["Gross Profit",2025] == 315                                          |
